{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#card-zh","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 为 DSH 提供回合完成和错误语音提醒。它监听会话与工具事件，按回合去重；用户可选择语音、内置音效或关闭提醒，并在设置面板调整播报内容和音色。适合希望在 DSH 后台运行时及时获知任务结果的人。内置音效不需要 API Key；在线合成需要对应的语音服务 Key。支持通过 Web 设置页管理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:783-794","lib/engine.js:231-310","lib/tts.js:45-58","lib/client.js:3244-3250"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#card-en","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-voice-alert plays voice or sound alerts when DSH turns finish or fail. It listens for session and tool events, deduplicates per turn, and offers speech, built-in effects, or silence in its settings panel. Built-in effects need no API key; online synthesis needs a service key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:783-794","lib/engine.js:231-310","lib/tts.js:45-58","lib/client.js:3244-3250"]}
