{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#feature-1","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「回合结果提醒」：监听 DSH 的 turn/start 与 turn/end 事件，回合结束时播放完成或失败提示；已报错的回合优先播放失败提示，避免重复通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:783-794","lib/engine.js:231-310"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#feature-2","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「失败即时提醒」：agent 报错或工具结果标记为失败时立即触发失败提示，并按回合去重和错误间隔限制减少重复播报。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/engine.js:316-378"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#feature-3","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「提醒方式切换」：可在语音、内置音效和关闭三种模式间选择，为完成、失败和手动审批提示使用对应的播报方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/config.js:54-58","lib/config.js:96-102"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#feature-4","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 的功能「提醒设置面板」：在 DSH 原生设置分区注册语音播报面板，用户可管理播报内容与音色相关设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3244-3259"]}
{"unit_id":"loyalchiiina__dsh-voice-alert#caveat-1","repo":"loyalchiiina/dsh-voice-alert","commit":"4a79039f8d84718689cdc5c1a4dcf44cdac879b7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-alert 使用克隆或预设音色生成语音时，会把播报文本发送到火山引擎语音合成接口；这些模式分别需要对应的 API Key。只用内置音效不需要 Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tts.js:22-23","lib/tts.js:45-58"]}
